      "name": "Definitely Sneaky But Not Sneaky",
      "steam_appid": 954010,
      "required_age": 0,
      "is_free": false,
      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Definitely Sneaky But Not Sneaky is a top-down action game packed with difficult levels. Hack, slash, and shoot everything in your path. Earn points by efficiently completing missions to unlock different weapons, items, and skills you can combine into your loadouts!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-person local multiplayer is featured with the ability to mix different control types (one player on a keyboard, another on a PS4 controller, and a third on an Xbox controller, etc.) to get as many people playing as possible. Use Steam's <i>Remote Play</i> feature to play with other Steam users with just one copy of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Action-Stealth gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approach missions in different ways depending on your loadout and strategy. Take out enemies before they notice you with close-ranged melee and silenced weapons! Or run in with a shotgun and some grenades. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slow-mo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow-motion effects activate throughout the game. Use them to your advantage to dodge bullets or get a second to make a decision!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Party mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play local co-op versus with 2-4 players. Go free-for-all or split into teams! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Zombie mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive never-ending waves of zombies, purchase upgrades with kills, and explore the larger maps! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mission editor with Steam Workshop integration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the built-in editor, create all the missions you can see in the Missions mode and more! Create your missions, string them into mission packs, and share them with the Steam community via Steam Workshop. Download others' published packs to play for yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gamepad support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With both keyboard/mouse and controller support, you can play the game whichever way is more comfortable. However, it's <strong>important</strong> to note that the game will play better with a controller.</p>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Definitely Sneaky But Not Sneaky is a top-down action game packed with difficult levels. Hack, slash, and shoot everything in your path. Earn points by efficiently completing missions to unlock different weapons, items, and skills you can combine into your loadouts!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-person local multiplayer is featured with the ability to mix different control types (one player on a keyboard, another on a PS4 controller, and a third on an Xbox controller, etc.) to get as many people playing as possible. Use Steam's <i>Remote Play</i> feature to play with other Steam users with just one copy of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Action-Stealth gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approach missions in different ways depending on your loadout and strategy. Take out enemies before they notice you with close-ranged melee and silenced weapons! Or run in with a shotgun and some grenades. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slow-mo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow-motion effects activate throughout the game. Use them to your advantage to dodge bullets or get a second to make a decision!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Party mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play local co-op versus with 2-4 players. Go free-for-all or split into teams! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Zombie mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive never-ending waves of zombies, purchase upgrades with kills, and explore the larger maps! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mission editor with Steam Workshop integration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the built-in editor, create all the missions you can see in the Missions mode and more! Create your missions, string them into mission packs, and share them with the Steam community via Steam Workshop. Download others' published packs to play for yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gamepad support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With both keyboard/mouse and controller support, you can play the game whichever way is more comfortable. However, it's <strong>important</strong> to note that the game will play better with a controller.</p>",
      "short_description": "Definitely Sneaky But Not Sneaky is a fast-paced action game featuring tight controls and slow-mo combat. Unlock items, customize your gear, and take out your enemies one by one! Co-op included.",
